msgstr "Pridobite vtičnik Activities za vsako noč!"

#: ../plugins/activities.rst:23 d4ab30bc1e7a49db8ec862aa532dfe38
msgid ""
"Extract the downloaded archive in Galette ``plugins`` directory. For "
